<InfoPage
  title="About Typing Multiplayer"
  description="Learn about Typing Multiplayer, a free online typing race that makes typing practice more social, focused, and fun."
>
  <p>Typing Multiplayer is a free browser-based typing game built to make keyboard practice feel more engaging. Instead of practising alone, players can create a room, invite friends, and race through the same passage together.</p>
  <p>Each race tracks typing speed, accuracy, mistakes, and progress. The goal is not only to type quickly, but to build a comfortable rhythm and improve accuracy over time.</p>
  <p>The tool is useful for students, typing clubs, teachers, families, teams, and anyone who wants a lightweight typing speed test or friendly typing race. No installation is required. Choose a name, create or join a room, and start typing.</p>
  <p>Typing Multiplayer uses Supabase to synchronize rooms and player progress in real time. We aim to keep the experience simple, welcoming, and useful for regular typing practice.</p>
</InfoPage>
